an10.212:4.10 starts: ‘There is what is given … there are
an10.21:3.4 starts: Since the Tathāgata understands as it really is the possible
an10.21:4.2 starts: Since the Tathāgata understands as it really is … the result
an10.21:5.2 starts: Since the Tathāgata understands as it really is the ways
an10.21:6.2 starts: Since the Tathāgata understands as it really is the world
an10.21:7.2 starts: Since the Tathāgata understands as it really is the diversity
an10.21:8.2 starts: Since the Tathāgata understands as it really is the superior
an10.21:9.2 starts: Since the Tathāgata understands as it really is the defilement
an10.21:10.2 starts: Since the Tathāgata recollects his manifold past abodes
an10.21:11.2 starts: Since the Tathāgata … understands how beings fare
an10.21:12.2 starts: Since the Tathāgata has realized for himself …
